ImagoKit (a Swift package the app is built with)
================================================================================

The app links ImagoKit (https://github.com/mac4DSTEM/ImagoKit, tag 0.7.0, commit
41b4b617d108084f8cb2cf22acc4042614eb92d1), Copyright (C) 2026 Paul Lobpreis, GPL-3.0-only, for the exact-length 2D FFT, the
